          "path": "_m/g/c/u/v/clyde-tunnel-wp/clyde-tunnel-southside-cycle-e.jpg",
          "filename": "Clyde Tunnel - Southside cycle exit - geograph.org.uk - 508249.jpg",
          "caption": "Clyde Tunnel - Southside cycle exit The view of the exit for cyclists from the south side of the Clyde Tunnel.  Pedestrians are also able to enter the tunnel at this point.  Pedestrians and cyclists share the same tunnel, but each have a separate section.  The cycle path operates on a one way system while pedestrians can travel in either direction.",
          "alt": "Clyde Tunnel - Southside cycle exit The view of the exit for cyclists from the south side of the Clyde Tunnel.  Pedestrians are also able to enter the tunnel at this point.  Pedestrians and cyclists share the same tunnel, but each have a separate section.  The cycle path operates on a one way system while pedestrians can travel in either direction.",
